Third-party components in the optional "agent" extra
----------------------------------------------------

The base installation (the worker environment) depends only on packages
published under permissive open-source licenses.

The optional "agent" extra (pip/uv extra name: agent) installs
mistralai-agents (Apache-2.0) from PyPI, which in turn installs:

  - mistralai-vibe-harness, whose PyPI metadata declares "License: Proprietary"
    and which ships a compiled core;
  - mistralai-vibe-sdk, which publishes no license metadata and no license file.

These packages are downloaded from PyPI at install time. They are never
vendored, copied or redistributed by this project. Their terms are set by
their publisher; by installing the "agent" extra you accept those terms.
